# Written by hand (ADR 0049): a grid of streets dragged over a small town's east edge while
# cars drive. Edges beside town streets are left out, the rest join and split them. Then a
# grid of main roads is refused for money and an alley grid for its class.
sim-game command log 1
seed 1
grid 4 4
0 spawn 60
50 fill 50 50 residential-low
300 roadgrid 280 -40 1 0 80 4 5 street
600 fill 460 80 commercial-low
900 roadgrid 700 -40 1 0 112 20 20 main
900 roadgrid 700 -40 1 0 80 2 2 alley
end 3000
expect hash a55e63101b9d1756 population 21 buildings 15 trips 103
